<title>JAPAN: S.Arabia ups Mar Super Light price to Asia - traders.</title>
<headline>S.Arabia ups Mar Super Light price to Asia - traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabia has raised the March crude oil price formula for Arab Super Light to Asia by 20 cents per barrel, setting it at an average of Oman/Dubai plus $3.45, compared with plus $3.25 in February, traders said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
